    LLM: "1. Ante/Blinds. 2. Deal 3 cards face-down. 3. Players simultaneously 'roll' (reveal) one card. 4. Betting round. 5. Deal 4th card down; players reveal one of their hidden cards. 6. Repeat for 5th and 6th cards. 7. Deal 7th card down. 8. Final betting round and Showdown.",
    Player: "1. Ante/Blinds. 2. Deal 3 cards face-down. 3. Players simultaneously 'roll' (reveal) one card. 4. Betting round. 5. Deal 4th card down; players reveal one of their hidden cards. 6. Repeat for 5th and 6th cards. 7. Deal 7th card down. 8. Final betting round and Showdown.",
